      "created_at": "2022-05-22T14:34:43.293Z",
      "cooked": "<p><strong>I created a custom workspace, and now I’m facing a problem when I want to work on this workspace, where I get this message: “Field not permitted in query: occupancy_status”!!!</strong><br>\n<strong>What does this message mean?? And what’s the problem??</strong><br>\n<strong>I need help… <img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/images/emoji/twitter/woozy_face.png?v=12\" title=\":woozy_face:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":woozy_face:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"></strong><br>\n<div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/0/f/0f4b9a0ecee3a197c11c5800ed10cf10d585a0e1.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/0f4b9a0ecee3a197c11c5800ed10cf10d585a0e1\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/0/f/0f4b9a0ecee3a197c11c5800ed10cf10d585a0e1_2_689x310.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"2bj8z0YPStXkoh3N8uJfduGTVFD\" width=\"689\" height=\"310\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/0/f/0f4b9a0ecee3a197c11c5800ed10cf10d585a0e1_2_689x310.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/0/f/0f4b9a0ecee3a197c11c5800ed10cf10d585a0e1_2_1033x465.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/0/f/0f4b9a0ecee3a197c11c5800ed10cf10d585a0e1.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"979A9E\"><div class=\"meta\">\n<svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">1346×605 54.8 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg>\n</div></a></div></p>",
