    {
      "id": 343940,
      "username": "ziad_alswary",
      "name": "ziad alswary",
      "created_at": "2022-11-01T18:51:31.421Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I got this error when I open a certain workspace, so if this error appears with you when you open a workspace<br>\nAll you have to do is go to <strong>Build</strong> → <strong>Workspace</strong> → chose the workspace that has this error<br>\nthen in the <strong>Shortcuts</strong> section open and check every Shortcut’s <strong>Count Filter</strong> conditions<br>\nMake sure that all fields you wrote in  <strong>Count Filter</strong> field are exist in the Doctype that selected in <strong>Link to</strong> field</p>",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/discuss.frappe.io/ziad_alswary/{size}/46455_2.png",
      "trust_level": 1,
      "post_number": 8,
      "post_type": 1,
