    {
      "id": 395931,
      "username": "MohamedAbdulsalam",
      "name": "Mohamed Abdulsalam",
      "created_at": "2024-02-27T23:11:27.055Z",
      "cooked": "<p><a class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/hendrik_sejati\">@hendrik_sejati</a><br>\nStandardly…<br>\nThe called field must be exist in the same doctype that was selected in the “<strong>Link to</strong>\" field…<br>\nChild table represents a separate DocType, so this is a drawback…</p>\n<p>However, you can try using double call syntax, by separating on comma, like so:<br>\n<strong>child_table_field.field_to_be_called</strong></p>",
